  "description": "The Titan Pro 15K Prefilled Pod Vape Kit is built for lasting performance and effortless flavour. Combining a 2ml prefilled pod with an integrated 10ml refill container, it uses smart auto-feed technology to keep the coil perfectly saturated, delivering up to 15,000 puffs with clean, consistent taste. Powered by a 1000mAh battery and equipped with a 1.2ohm mesh coil, the Titan Pro balances efficiency with flavour precision. Its compact design, Boost Mode option and inhale activation make it simple to use while offering impressive MTL (mouth-to-lung) vapour production. There are no coils or buttons to manage — just steady, satisfying flavour every time. >The Titan Pro 15K represents the next step in prefilled pod technology — durable, clean, and built for long-term value. Designed for vapers who want extended use without compromise, it pairs convenience with refined performance and flavour consistency. How To Set Up Titan Pro 15K Kit Step 1 Insert the prefilled pod into the Titan Pro device until it clicks securely. Step 2 Fit the 10ml refill container into the base compartment. Step 3 Inhale on the mouthpiece to vape — no settings or adjustments needed. Step 4 Use the Type-C port to recharge when the indicator light signals low power. Step 5 Replace the pod pack once both pod and refill are empty. ✅ You're all set! Titan Pro 15K Kit Flavours • Blue Raspberry Sweet-tart Blue Raspberry flavour that stays bright and clear from start to finish. • Strawberry Raspberry Cherry Juicy Strawberry and tangy Raspberry layered with rich Cherry sweetness. • Cool Mint Fresh Mint flavour with a crisp, cooling exhale. • Lemon Lime Zesty Lemon and sharp Lime for a clean, citrus vape. • Cherry Cola Classic Cola notes with a sweet Cherry edge. • Cherry Fizz Sweet Cherry with a lively soda sparkle. • Blue Razz Lemonade Iconic Blue Raspberry flavour lifted by zesty Lemonade. • Strawberry Kiwi Watermelon A smooth, summery blend of ripe fruits. • Cola Freeze Familiar Cola flavour cooled by a brisk icy finish. • Triple Berries A rich mix of dark and bright Berry notes. • Fresh Mint Clean, cooling Mint with a light sweetness. • Tobacco Robust, balanced Tobacco flavour with a smooth finish. • Watermelon Ice Fresh, delicately sweet Watermelon with a brisk, icy lift. • Rainbow Burst A playful mix of fruit flavours with a sweet-sour twist. • Blueberry Sour Razz Blueberry sweetness balanced by a tangy Raspberry edge. • Banana Ice Smooth, ripe Banana with an icy aftertaste. • Pineapple Ice Tangy Pineapple flavour with a clean, cool exhale. • Pink Burst Sweet, confectionery-style fruit flavour with a bright finish. • Juicy Peach Soft, sweet Peach flavour that’s smooth and aromatic. • Grape Ice Dark, juicy Grape paired with an icy chill. Shop All Titan Pro 15K Refill Pods",
